1
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:08,840
Let's see if the snack shop owner
is around.

2
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:11,720
The snack shop owner
didn't show up today.

3
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:14,260
(Bends down to look)

4
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:18,420
(Leans in to listen)

5
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:20,200
No one's there.

6
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:20,840
He's asleep.

7
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,440
Where'd the owner go?

8
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:23,720
No idea. I didn't see him.

9
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:25,840
Who's in the stargazing room today?

10
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:26,720
Zhao Xilun.

11
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:28,160
Zhao Xilun and (Sha Yue'er).

12
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:30,680
The owner turned into an ostrich.

13
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:38,080
Hey, guys.

14
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:38,800
Hey.

15
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:40,560
Hey, guys.

16
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:41,680
You look good from this angle.

17
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:42,480
Do I?

18
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:43,240
So blue.

19
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:44,000
Wait, come here.

20
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:44,720
Let's take one. Okay.

21
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:47,300
Three, two, one.

22
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:50,640
This looks so good.

23
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:54,240
This camera's really good.

24
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,240
It's really nice.

25
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,000
Right?

26
00:00:56,440 --> 00:00:58,080
It's really a heart-flutter camera.

27
00:00:58,080 --> 00:00:59,080
(Capturing heart-fluttering moments)
Yeah.

28
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:01,400
I'll go figure out my camera later.

29
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:04,080
I'll compare it
with Chen Hewen's photos later.

30
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:06,200
He said he'd take new ones of us today.

31
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,720
He said he switched to new film.

32
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:08,520
Really?

33
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:10,800
Wasn't the last one he took of us

34
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:12,480
just our two heads?

35
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:13,880
Look at mine.

36
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:14,640
It's definitely better.

37
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:16,240
Cui Kaiyi, don't bad-mouth me!

38
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,840
Cui Kaiyi, don't bad-mouth me!

39
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:26,680
When did I bad-mouth you?

40
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:27,980
(Opens)
I heard you.

41
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:28,660
(Closes)

42
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:31,280
Why does he have a window?

43
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:32,000
Snack shop.

44
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,720
Why does he have a window?

45
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:35,320
His window opens.

46
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:37,480
Can I take a look?

47
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:38,560
Sure.

48
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:42,860
It's so... you know, over here.

49
00:01:42,860 --> 00:01:44,420
(Gathers around)

50
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:45,160
I just took a nap.

51
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:45,720
I was exhausted.

52
00:01:45,720 --> 00:01:46,920
I was dead tired when I got back today.

53
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,320
You were here just now?

54
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:49,280
I was lying right here.

55
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,280
I was actually reading.

56
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:50,800
At first,

57
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:52,220
I probably read for ten minutes.

58
00:01:52,220 --> 00:01:52,700
Maybe fifteen.

59
00:01:52,700 --> 00:01:54,200
Then I passed out right here.

60
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,680
Okay. I thought you were feeling down.

61
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,040
No, I was just asleep.

62
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:57,520
See you later.

63
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:59,040
Bye.

64
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:03,320
She thought he was upset.

65
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:13,320
Okay, I'm here.

66
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,360
Aren't these two the same?

67
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:17,080
Did it win you over too?

68
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:17,640
I'll get one too.

69
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:18,800
Just wait, guys.

70
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:22,880
Soon the Signal House
will be full of these cameras.

71
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,400
I bought it from someone in person.

72
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,560
Even the official store didn't have it.

73
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:29,080
Okay, back to where you were.

74
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,360
Hold that pose from before.

75
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,720
Then you sit.

76
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:32,640
Okay, here we go.

77
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:35,480
Nice.

78
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:36,960
Wait.

79
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:37,720
I know.

80
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:38,760
Three.

81
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,240
Chen Hewen.

82
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,480
Liang Xiaoyu.

83
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,160
Nice.

84
00:02:44,160 --> 00:02:45,480
I took this for you.

85
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:47,120
Looks good. Cute.

86
00:02:48,720 --> 00:02:50,000
You made me look so cute.

87
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:54,360
I'm keeping this one too.

88
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,040
Okay.

89
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:57,800
I'll take some of you guys.

90
00:02:58,160 --> 00:02:58,680
Sure. Come on.

91
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,440
Okay.

92
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:03,360
Three, two, one.

93
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,040
Every time there's a camera,

94
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:08,280
you start acting cute.

95
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,600
You can't blame me.

96
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:11,480
You can't blame me.

97
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:13,360
Every time there's a camera,
you start acting cute.

98
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:20,640
Look over here.

99
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:28,120
Acting cute again.

100
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:33,160
Take one for us.

101
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:34,040
Can we do serious faces?

102
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:34,360
Serious faces.

103
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,200
Okay.

104
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:36,680
You want one with serious faces?

105
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,240
Wait, let me compose myself.

106
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,800
The second you say
"serious face", I wanna laugh.

107
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:42,320
Wait.

108
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:43,080
Serious face.

109
00:03:45,460 --> 00:03:46,660
(Cracks up)

110
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:53,960
It's giving Green Snake and White Snake.

111
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,720
Green Snake and White Snake.

112
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,680
Breaking stereotypes.

113
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:00,960
Have you worn this one before?

114
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,480
I remember something similar.

115
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:03,580
I think I have.

116
00:04:03,580 --> 00:04:04,380
(Glances)

117
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:05,680
See? I remember.

118
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,400
No.

119
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:11,960
Looks good?

120
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,160
You had a plaid one before.

121
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:16,640
Looks like he got caught
by his roommate.

122
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:17,080
Yeah.

123
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,160
Sha Yue'er and the others aren't back yet?

124
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,000
The stargazing room's been busy.

125
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,680
For days straight.

126
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,320
Okay.

127
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:28,120
So pretty.

128
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,440
We look like...

129
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:31,560
Like what?

130
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:33,360
Like a boss lady
and her sweet little flower.

131
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,840
Can we go check it out first?

132
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:36,000
Can we pick tomorrow's
dishes a day early?

133
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,000
Go now?

134
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,420
Aren't they still using it today?

135
00:04:38,420 --> 00:04:39,180
(Looks back)

136
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:44,120
Having that much fun, huh?

137
00:04:44,620 --> 00:04:46,060
(Looks back)

138
00:04:50,100 --> 00:04:51,620
(Nods)

139
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:52,960
What are you nodding about?

140
00:04:52,960 --> 00:04:55,240
I just like nodding.

141
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,920
Cui Kaiyi really is everywhere

142
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:57,920
in this house.

143
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:01,400
I love nodding.

144
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:02,320
She said

145
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:04,320
we look like Green Snake
and White Snake.

146
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:05,480
The colors.

147
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:05,840
Here.

148
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:07,000
That's true.

149
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:08,320
Looks good.

150
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:13,280
Beautiful.

151
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:14,600
So beautiful.

152
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:18,400
Chen Hewen's waiting.

153
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:20,280
He's watching to see
when Sha Yue'er gets back.

154
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:27,920
She can clearly tell he's holding back.

155
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,480
He seems different from before.

156
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:31,040
Yeah, he's keeping some distance.

157
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,760
Looks good.

158
00:05:45,840 --> 00:05:47,680
Xizhilang Plum Jelly for you.

159
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:49,920
Peach flavor.

160
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:51,600
Thanks. This is my favorite flavor.

161
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:55,440
It's sweet and tangy. So good.

162
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:56,920
And it feels pretty guilt-free.

163
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:58,520
Glad you like it.

164
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:00,040
I hope every day from now on

165
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,680
is even happier than today.

166
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:02,800
I'll remember that.

167
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:03,560
Let's have some together.

168
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,040
Okay.

169
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:04,800
Here, have one.

170
00:06:09,140 --> 00:06:11,700
(Zhao Xilun and Sha Yue'er
return to the Signal House)

171
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:12,600
They're back.

172
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:20,160
After you.

173
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,440
Thanks.

174
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:25,540
(Hears something)

175
00:06:25,700 --> 00:06:27,700
(Looks down)

176
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,320
He sees them.

177
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,280
Why's everyone already eating?

178
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:35,680
Did you get one of these?

179
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:36,280
No.

180
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:37,000
Then take one.

181
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:39,400
I want this one.

182
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:42,360
I want this one.

183
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:44,440
Here they come.

184
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:47,880
What is everyone eating?

185
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:51,200
Quail eggs and beef.

186
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:51,960
Don't know who brought them,

187
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:53,040
but I brought them up here.

188
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,440
Interesting.

189
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:57,720
Because I'm really...

190
00:06:58,080 --> 00:06:59,280
really kind of hungry.

191
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:01,310
(Walks closer)
Slowly moves closer.

192
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:02,360
I'm starving.

193
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,840
Eat more.

194
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:06,120
Didn't you have dinner?

195
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:06,880
Not much.

196
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:07,600
They...

197
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:09,640
Tonight...

198
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:11,560
Si ordered takeout.

199
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,280
I had a little.

200
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:13,800
Whose beef slices are these?

201
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:14,600
Mine.

202
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,400
You can take them.

203
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:15,920
They're unopened.

204
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,240
But I still wanna try a couple.

205
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,600
Go ahead. You eat first.

206
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:19,080
Really?

207
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:19,840
Just keep it safe.

208
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:21,240
Okay.

209
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:23,920
Want some?

210
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:24,760
You can have mine.

211
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:25,360
No, thanks.

212
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,280
I'm gonna find my water bottle.

213
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:28,000
Bye.

214
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:28,760
Bye.

215
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,400
You didn't say bye to me.

216
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:31,560
Bye.

217
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,560
You didn't say bye to me.

218
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:33,800
Bye.

219
00:07:35,640 --> 00:07:36,120
Get some rest.

220
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:36,920
I'm looking for my water bottle.

221
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:38,280
I have no idea where it went.

222
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:42,560
Bye.

223
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:44,080
Bye.

224
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:45,640
Bye.

225
00:07:47,280 --> 00:07:48,480
Bye.

226
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:49,880
Bye.

227
00:07:52,020 --> 00:07:53,860
(Hums)

228
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:55,160
How'd it go?

229
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:56,360
Pretty happy, huh?

230
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:58,600
I had a great time.

231
00:07:58,600 --> 00:08:00,200
This is the gift she gave me.

232
00:08:00,260 --> 00:08:01,640
(Shows the gift from Sha Yue'er)
What'd she get you?

233
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:02,520
A keyboard.

234
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:04,440
Sha Yue'er got Zhao Xilun a gift?

235
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,880
(Two hours earlier)
I don't know if you'll like it.

236
00:08:08,340 --> 00:08:09,980
(Keyboard)

237
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,040
I really like it.

238
00:08:12,080 --> 00:08:12,720
Thank you.

239
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:13,760
You're welcome.

240
00:08:14,220 --> 00:08:16,140
(Holds it close)

241
00:08:16,340 --> 00:08:18,180
(Happy)

242
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:19,000
(Happy)
That's a great gift.

243
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:19,840
He's really happy.

244
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:21,600
Super happy.

245
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:23,160
Here.

246
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:24,880
Why are you pinky-promising me?

247
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:31,660
I promise I'm happy.

248
00:08:31,660 --> 00:08:32,860
(I promise I'm happy)

249
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:36,360
I promise I'm happy.

250
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:38,040
(Two hours earlier)
Can I put it back in first?

251
00:08:38,040 --> 00:08:38,920
I think this bag

252
00:08:38,920 --> 00:08:39,400
looks really nice.

253
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:40,360
Sure.

254
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:43,040
You really treasure gifts
from someone you like.

255
00:08:43,040 --> 00:08:43,680
Thank you.

256
00:08:43,740 --> 00:08:44,820
(Very carefully)

257
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:45,480
It's okay.

258
00:08:48,560 --> 00:08:49,080
That goofy grin.

259
00:08:49,780 --> 00:08:51,180
(Smiles)

260
00:08:51,800 --> 00:08:52,680
A keyboard.

261
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:55,520
Now he's showing it off.

262
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:57,160
Look what I got.

263
00:08:58,040 --> 00:08:59,600
Is this what you two wrote?

264
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,680
That time capsule thing?

265
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:02,240
No.

266
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:03,800
(Promise letter)
This is the promise letter I wrote.

267
00:09:04,400 --> 00:09:05,680
This promise letter of yours...

268
00:09:05,680 --> 00:09:07,280
With the fingerprints, it kinda looks

269
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:08,440
like

270
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:09,120
a marriage certificate.

271
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:11,840
He's so happy.

272
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,280
Something to remember it by.

273
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:19,840
What'd you do today?

274
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,440
Nothing much. I just wrote letters.

275
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,320
There's something about Sun Bohan

276
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:23,840
that always gives me

277
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:25,000
this hard-to-explain

278
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,440
sense of comfort.

279
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,720
He's almost a writer now.

280
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:30,040
With the glasses too.

281
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:32,160
He's always been pretty good with words.

282
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:34,640
This smells so good.

283
00:09:39,660 --> 00:09:40,500
(Notices)

284
00:09:40,520 --> 00:09:41,640
You're really happy today.

285
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,560
Is this yours?

286
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:46,680
Yeah.

287
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:48,360
When I got back tonight,

288
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,600
you weren't in the stargazing room.

289
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:50,920
So since you weren't there,

290
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:51,960
I tried on your glasses.

291
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:54,640
Tastes good.

292
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:58,960
Feels like you barely ate tonight.

293
00:09:58,960 --> 00:09:59,520
You know?

294
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:01,240
