318
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:47,600
You're upset again today.

319
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:48,600
Yeah.

320
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:56,240
So, how'd your talk go today?

321
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,720
You two took pictures, right?

322
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:00,600
