331
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:25,160
You two look so good together.

332
00:11:26,160 --> 00:11:26,800
Of course.

333
00:11:31,560 --> 00:11:32,840
Why does he look

334
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,240
