335
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,080
Guess he needs a good backdrop.

336
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,520
Someone's gotta make him look good.

337
00:11:41,880 --> 00:11:43,240
How was your day?

338
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:45,760
Still really happy.

339
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:49,840
You're happy every day.

340
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:50,480
Pretty happy.

341
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:52,160
What'd we talk about? I forgot.

342
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:57,920
Cao Yiheng unlocked

343
00:11:57,920 --> 00:11:58,680
