347
00:12:01,760 --> 00:12:04,040
Zhao Xilun beat him to it.

348
00:12:04,300 --> 00:12:07,500
(The night before)

349
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:09,260
(Inserts Master Kong Jasmine Coin)

350
00:12:10,180 --> 00:12:11,220
