a little over a week left.

363
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,600
That went by fast.

364
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:38,160
Yeah.

365
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:39,800
It doesn't feel that fast.

366
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:41,600
Yeah.

367
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:43,800
Time flies.

368
00:12:45,940 --> 00:12:47,660
(Looks at photos with Sha Yue'er)

369
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:52,920
♪Guess I still said♪

370
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,800
♪Bye-bye♪

371
00:12:55,800 --> 00:12:57,720
