377
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:26,240
Were these all taken today?

378
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:26,920
Yeah.

379
00:13:26,920 --> 00:13:29,480
This is our retro disco look.

380
00:13:29,960 --> 00:13:30,800
Couple edition.

381
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,640
So many memories.

382
00:13:40,520 --> 00:13:40,840
Look.

383
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:42,360
We took two color photos today.

384
00:13:54,320 --> 00:13:56,080
The three guys in this room
are pretty neat.

385
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:57,560
Right?

386
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:03,280
We got a message.

387
00:14:03,920 --> 00:14:05,120
What?

388
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:07,520
What does it say?

389
00:14:07,700 --> 00:14:10,100
(Heart-to-heart moment rules)

390
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:11,160
The last day.

391
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:12,400
The last day?

392
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:14,520
What does this mean?

393
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,560
Next,

394
00:14:15,560 --> 00:14:17,600
everyone will have

395
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:18,760
a heart-to-heart moment.

396
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:20,160
They'll get the chance

397
00:14:20,160 --> 00:14:21,680
to confess their feelings early.

398
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:23,240
It's confession time.

399
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:23,800
Today

400
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:25,280
is their last day

401
00:14:25,280 --> 00:14:26,520
living in the Signal House.

402
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:27,960
They'll have

403
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:29,200
the whole night

404
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:30,480
to think about how

405
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:32,120
they want to move forward

406
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,840
with the person they like

407
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:35,440
into the next stage.

408
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:36,560
(Signal House, Couples House)
After sunrise,

409
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:37,560
they'll head to

410
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:39,240
the mailbox by the wishing well

411
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:40,080
at the Signal House

412
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:42,160
and make their choice.

413
00:14:42,160 --> 00:14:43,280
(Heart-to-heart moment rules)

414
00:14:43,280 --> 00:14:44,320
This is intense.

415
00:14:44,640 --> 00:14:45,840
We're leaving?

416
00:14:45,840 --> 00:14:47,440
I even booked the stargazing room
for tomorrow night.

417
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,520
How did it come to this?

418
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:51,360
That was fast.

419
00:14:51,590 --> 00:14:51,920
Oh my God.

420
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:52,520
We're not seriously

421
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:54,240
