430
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:08,680
B means

431
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:10,160
you want to keep
getting to know each other.

432
00:15:10,280 --> 00:15:11,680
C means leaving, right?

433
00:15:11,680 --> 00:15:12,160
Yeah.

434
00:15:12,160 --> 00:15:13,120
I think besides C,

435
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:14,040
the other two

436
00:15:14,040 --> 00:15:16,000
