437
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:17,880
But with B, you don't name anyone.

438
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:18,800
Oh my God.

439
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:22,400
Why is this happening so fast?

440
00:15:26,880 --> 00:15:27,840
Sha Yue'er.

441
00:15:29,800 --> 00:15:30,440
Do you remember?

442
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,720
When we first started filming

443
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:32,280
Heart Signal

444
00:15:32,280 --> 00:15:33,000
this season,

445
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:34,280
we told everyone

446
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:34,920
that midway

447
00:15:34,920 --> 00:15:35,760
through the show,

448
00:15:35,760 --> 00:15:36,880
if you feel like

449
00:15:36,880 --> 00:15:38,360
you just can't wait anymore

450
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:39,600
and want to start dating now...

451
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,240
It's only Episode 7.

452
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:42,320
We'd move the final choice

453
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:43,280
