up to Episode 7.

455
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:46,760
(Worried)
What about the last three episodes?

456
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:48,400
Sweetness. Pure sweetness.

457
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:49,200
Pure sugar.

458
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:49,800
Just us

459
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:50,840
