460
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:51,640
watching the cute couples.

461
00:15:55,280 --> 00:15:57,120
Today's the last day?

462
00:15:58,400 --> 00:15:59,760
Then what happens tomorrow?

463
00:15:59,920 --> 00:16:01,480
Tomorrow, we start choosing

464
00:16:01,480 --> 00:16:02,160
what kind

465
00:16:02,880 --> 00:16:04,520
