468
00:16:07,920 --> 00:16:09,720
How do you suddenly switch modes?

469
00:16:09,720 --> 00:16:10,920
Hi, boyfriend.

470
00:16:12,880 --> 00:16:14,200
She's been dying to say that, huh?

471
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:15,360
Then they can

472
00:16:15,360 --> 00:16:16,680
