473
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:17,920
Would it feel too awkward to say?

474
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:18,760
Hi, boyfriend.

475
00:16:18,800 --> 00:16:20,160
Everyone was so reserved before.

476
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:20,440
Yeah.

477
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:21,800
Now they'll have to hold hands
when they meet.

478
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:24,040
I'm getting nervous.

479
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:25,040
I don't even know why.

480
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:26,360
I put myself in their shoes.

481
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:28,200
I'm wondering if

482
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:29,480
