483
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:32,960
You're really happy.

484
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:34,960
(Liang Renfang)
Just hearing his name

485
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:36,280
next to the word "boyfriend"...

486
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:37,320
I can't explain it.

487
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:38,040
It just

488
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:39,520
makes me wanna smile.

489
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:40,200
When you put them together,

490
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:42,200
you realize you really like it.

491
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:44,480
I just can't stop smiling.

492
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:48,960
Do you think he's the type

493
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:50,120
to choose A?

494
00:16:50,680 --> 00:16:51,560
You mean...

495
00:16:52,160 --> 00:16:53,640
Cui Yihang.

496
00:16:56,040 --> 00:16:57,080
I think he will.

497
00:16:59,320 --> 00:17:00,240
(Wu Siying)
I still hope

498
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,480
