499
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:03,840
I think that's pretty important.

500
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:14,600
Now, after careful consideration,

501
00:17:14,600 --> 00:17:16,280
(Yu Yang)
please choose

502
00:17:16,280 --> 00:17:18,080
