503
00:17:18,840 --> 00:17:19,920
I think

504
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:21,560
there's no need to overthink it.

505
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:21,960
Yeah.

506
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:23,560
There's nothing to hesitate about.

507
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:25,800
I'm not hesitating.

508
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:27,160
There's nothing to hesitate about.

509
00:17:27,520 --> 00:17:29,280
I don't need to think anymore.

510
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:31,280
I've thought about it for a long time.

511
00:17:32,320 --> 00:17:33,200
A long time?

512
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:34,400
A long time.

513
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:37,120
(Cui Yihang)
Guys should be a little braver.

514
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:38,440
Even if the girl picks B,

515
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:39,120
