521
00:17:46,800 --> 00:17:48,080
I think so too.

522
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:49,840
It'll probably be some kind of...

523
00:17:49,840 --> 00:17:50,960
Hidden paradise.

524
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:52,880
Yeah.

525
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:54,400
They're already imagining it.

526
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:01,800
These three are happy.

527
00:18:02,840 --> 00:18:03,760
They're excited.

528
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:04,560
Yeah.

529
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:22,080
Now he's getting anxious.

530
00:18:28,760 --> 00:18:30,720
Mostly because he's unsure
how Sha Yue'er feels.

531
00:18:34,040 --> 00:18:35,520
What do you think Zhao Xilun will choose?

532
00:18:35,800 --> 00:18:36,640
Zhao Xilun will choose

533
00:18:36,640 --> 00:18:37,240
A.

534
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:38,600
(Disagrees)
Not necessarily.

535
00:18:38,600 --> 00:18:40,400
He definitely wants to choose A.

536
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:41,280
He wants A.

537
00:18:41,280 --> 00:18:42,960
But if Sha Yue'er sees

538
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:44,360
that he's basically saying,

539
00:18:44,360 --> 00:18:45,600
be my girlfriend,

540
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:46,520
she might

541
00:18:46,520 --> 00:18:47,240
get scared.

542
00:18:47,240 --> 00:18:48,280
Yeah, it could feel like too much.

543
00:18:48,280 --> 00:18:48,960
Too much pressure.

544
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:49,400
Too aggressive.

545
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:50,360
Yeah, too much pressure.

546
00:18:50,370 --> 00:18:51,400
(Judge mode activated)
For these two guys,

547
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:52,040
whether they pick A or B

548
00:18:52,040 --> 00:18:52,640
doesn't matter.

549
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:53,760
It depends on who Sha Yue'er chooses.

550
00:18:53,760 --> 00:18:54,320
That's when A or B

551
00:18:54,320 --> 00:18:55,200
