552
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:55,960
Yeah.

553
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:58,360
What about Sun Bohan?

554
00:18:58,360 --> 00:18:59,520
Sun Bohan, B.

555
00:18:59,520 --> 00:19:01,000
They can get to know each other better.

556
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,360
Sun Bohan could pick A too.

557
00:19:02,360 --> 00:19:03,720
Of course, A!

558
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:04,480
After all this time,

559
00:19:04,480 --> 00:19:05,080
isn't that enough?

560
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:06,280
He's missed Xing like crazy.

561
00:19:06,280 --> 00:19:07,560
But it's a little sudden.

562
00:19:07,560 --> 00:19:08,840
They haven't seen each other in so long,

563
00:19:08,840 --> 00:19:09,600
and then the moment they meet,

564
00:19:09,600 --> 00:19:10,780
(Moving fast)
they're boyfriend and girlfriend.

565
00:19:11,520 --> 00:19:12,440
No, I think

566
00:19:12,440 --> 00:19:13,360
he can choose A.

567
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:14,120
He can.

568
00:19:14,120 --> 00:19:15,480
He definitely has to choose A.

569
00:19:21,040 --> 00:19:21,920
She's torn.

570
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:25,520
So fast.

571
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:27,080
I haven't even finished my thesis.

572
00:19:27,080 --> 00:19:29,000
