573
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:30,600
Told you you wouldn't finish it!

574
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:33,840
Can we still use
the stargazing room tomorrow?

575
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:34,880
Seriously.

576
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:36,160
We booked it for nothing.

577
00:19:39,840 --> 00:19:41,240
You wanna choose A, right?

578
00:19:41,600 --> 00:19:42,920
Does she even need to think?

579
00:19:42,920 --> 00:19:44,160
I'm definitely choosing A.

580
00:19:52,360 --> 00:19:53,560
Which one do you wanna choose?

581
00:19:53,560 --> 00:19:54,310
I don't know.

582
00:20:01,840 --> 00:20:03,080
So with either of those two,

583
00:20:03,080 --> 00:20:04,520
